Compile out Kimchi's self-update: Nix owns the binary, and the store copy is
read-only. Both update gates are hardwired off, so `/update` and `kimchi
update` find no update, and the auto-update tip reads the same gate and stays
hidden. User-facing text is left as upstream wrote it. The `opts.signal!`
assertion keeps TypeScript's narrowing in the now-unreachable launch path.

